  "description": "Ga-Ram, a promiscuous student on the Korea University campus, yearns to hook up with Jin-Hun, a classmate. He's always eager to get close, but Jin-Hun consistently ignores him...\n\nWhile trying to figure out how to get Jin-Hun's pants off, Ga-Ram dreams of a strange old woman giving him a wish-granting magnet. The next day, when he encounters Jin-Hun, they're instantly hooked?! The two try various methods to break up...\n\n*\"Hey, try it with me. Then we might break up.\"*\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
